@startuml supervision
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title C8 - supported outside supervision and exact owned cgroup absence
start
:Capture one CLOCK_BOOTTIME origin before per-attempt work;
:Create selected immutable job with C2 and explicit remaining limits;
:Hold at boot barrier without game or policy work;
:Check trusted manager identity and controls;
:Bind owned init to exact approved host cgroup;
:Check effective limits and membership through read-only observation;
:Release one fixed native-proof command;
if (BOTH init/open/pass and clean child close before S0+10s?) then (yes)
  :Require natural job exit and successful owned CLI reap;
  :Remove the stopped job normally;
else (no)
  :Fail attempt and stop complete owned job without retry;
endif
:Require exact bound cgroup disappearance before S0+300s;
note right
  End normal work by S0+297s.
  Stable observation root and approved parent remain required.
  Empty cgroup or Docker removal alone cannot establish absence.
  Synthetic fixtures grant no host execution authority.
end note
stop
@enduml
